The four headers in this folder (js_native_api.h, js_native_api_types.h,
node_api.h, node_api_types.h) are copied unchanged from Node.js v26.13.1
(include/node). keychain.cc compiles them with NAPI_VERSION 8, so only the
stable Node-API 8 surface is used. Node.js licence follows.

